  <data name="How long the gateway waits for the backend to START responding. Does NOT include auth, rate-limit queue, or concurrency-slot waiting. Once streaming begins, no time limit applies. SUGGESTED VALUES: small models (≤8B, NVMe SSD) → 60–120s; large models (≥27B or HDD/NAS storage) → 600–1800s; embedding models → 30–60s." xml:space="preserve">
